<section class="wrap section section--flush" id="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p>
      <h2 id="problem-title">Agencies need a current picture of their workforce as AI changes the work</h2>
      <ul class="quotes quotes--solo"><li><figure><blockquote><p>The LLM narrates and drafts; it never computes a figure.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="cite"><strong>Bluebird Horizon</strong>Platform and hosting</figcaption></figure></li></ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="copy">
        <p>AI is changing the work the APS does, and agencies are being asked to plan for it. Australian Government policy now includes the AI Plan for the APS, the Policy for the responsible use of AI in government and the Data, Digital and Cyber Workforce Plan.</p>
        <p>Planning well takes a current picture of the workforce and its skills, an honest forecast of where gaps will open, and a way to test options before committing to them.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="chart">
