<section class="band-mist" id="what" aria-labelledby="what-title">
  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">What it does</p>
        <h2 id="what-title">One place to see, forecast and plan the workforce</h2>
        <p>Horizon shows headcount, skills and AI task exposure by job family and agency. It forecasts workforce supply and demand to FY2030 and highlights capability gaps and risks.</p>
        <p>Planners can then test scenarios, map talent pathways, generate draft workforce strategies and reports, and ask questions about their workforce in plain language.</p>
        <p>AI is framed as capacity to redeploy to priority work, consistent with evidence that generative AI augments more work than it replaces.</p>
      </div>
