        <details id="horizon-intelligence"><summary><span class="acc-title">AI adoption intelligence</span><span class="hint">A daily feed, sources linked</span></summary><div class="acc-body">
          <p>A daily feed of news and Australian parliamentary material, including Hansard, Senate estimates and committee hearings where agencies answer for AI adoption and the workforce. The original source is linked on every item.</p>
        </div></details>
